# Drop caps (reference/components/text.md). Pages of 300 × 200 with margins of 20: page area of 260 × 160 from
# (20, 20). Lines of 12 (Size 10), 5 pt per character and capitals of 0.7 of the size (the approximate metrics).
# A drop cap of 3 lines spans 2 × 12 + 7 = 31 and is set at 31 / 0.7 = 44.29: its letter takes 22.14 and a space
# of the paragraph (5) more, 27.14; one of 2 lines spans 19, is set at 27.14 and takes 18.57. The paragraphs are
# words of four letters, 25 each with the space; the first one loses its first letter and takes 20.
#
# Section 1: d1 (39 words, Drop cap: 3): the first three lines have 232.86 and hold 9 words each; the other two,
#   10 and 2: 5 lines, 60. d2 (5 words, Drop cap: 2) has one line but measures the 2 lines of its drop cap, 24, so
#   p3 comes after it at 104.
# Section 2: img (60 × 60, right margin 10) at the left and d4 (43 words, Drop cap: 3) beside it: its first three
#   lines have 260 − 70 − 27.14 = 162.86 and hold 6 words, the next two, beside the image only, 7, and then 10 and
#   1: 7 lines, 84.
# Section 3: sp (130) leaves 30, two lines, and d5 (Drop cap: 3, 5 lines) does not fit with its three first lines:
#   it moves whole to page 4.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Language: es
	Title: Prueba
	Page:
		Width: 300
		Height: 200
		Margin: 20
	Styles:
		For element: Document
			Typography:
				Font: IBM Plex Sans
				Size: 10
	Section:
		Paragraph: Xaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa
			Id: d1
			Drop cap: 3
		Paragraph: Xaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa
			Id: d2
			Drop cap: 2
		Paragraph: aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa
			Id: p3
	Section:
		Image: test/square.png
			Id: img
			Side: left
			Box:
				Width: 60
				Height: 60
				Margin: 0 10 0 0
		Paragraph: Xaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa aaaa
			Id: d4
			Drop cap: 3
	Section:
		Block:
			Id: sp
